			"type":"text",
			"text":"If you have access to a Terminal, you can order an item so that it's available to buy at the [[Commissary]] for your runs.\n\nThis allows you to get a good start on a run by picking a good item such as Sledgehammer, Metal Detector or Magnifying Lens.\n\nIt could even help you make Workshop combinations if used with the [[038 - Coat Check]] room.",
